,p_attribute_sequence=>1
,p_display_sequence=>10
,p_static_id=>'STYLE'
,p_prompt=>'Style'
,p_attribute_type=>'SELECT LIST'
,p_is_required=>true
,p_default_value=>'orbitRing'
,p_escape_mode=>'ATTR'
,p_is_translatable=>false
,p_lov_type=>'STATIC'
,p_help_text=>'Profile design, grouped by direction. MOTION - Orbit Ring: a rotating light ring around the avatar with the status dot in orbit. Beam Frame: two beams of light travel around the card frame. DEPTH - Tilt Holo ID: a staff ID card that tilts toward the pointer under a holographic sheen, with Organisation and Reference. Flip Contact: identity on the front, Email, Phone and Location on the back, turned on hover, focus or tap. Lanyard Badge: a conference badge hanging from a strap that sways gently. BOLD - Neo Brutal: ink borders, hard shadows and flat fills. Clay: pillowy soft-shadow surfaces. Sticker: a die-cut sticker with a peeling corner. SMART - Bento Profile: stats, bio and contact as bento tiles that recompose by region width. Expand Bio: a compact row that morphs open to show Bio, stats and contact on hover, focus or tap.'
);
